        {
          "id": "wheel_glide",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "顺坡滚动",
          "weight": 2,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\bar\\omega r,\\,0,\\,v_{\\text{cap}}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "cap_speed": 0.35,
            "wheel_radius": 0.0175
          },
          "desc": "奖励轮子向前滚动的线速度，封顶 0.35 m/s：鼓励顺坡滑下，而不是加速冲刺。",
          "note": "看轮子而不是躯干速度：推着躯干「跑」下去而轮子不滚拿不到分；轮子倒转（往回爬）为 0。上游注释：没有这一项，最优解是站着不动。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.wheel_glide_reward（mdp.py:1235）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "wheel_glide"
          },
          "curve": {
            "x": {
              "tex": "\\bar\\omega r",
              "range": [
                -0.2,
                0.7
              ]
            },
            "f": "min(max(x,0),cap)",
            "params": [
              {
                "id": "cap",
                "key": "cap_speed",
                "range": [
                  0.05,
                  1
                ]
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              "横轴是轮子的滚动线速度 ω̄r（m/s）。倒转为 0，0 到 v_cap 线性上升，超过 v_cap 封顶：没有继续加速的动机。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "alive",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "存活",
          "weight": 1,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "1",
          "desc": "每活一步给 1，配合倒地 / 掉出地形的终止条件，鼓励撑过整段下坡。",
          "note": "微鸭的 is_alive 直接返回全 1，不是 IsaacLab 那种 1 − 1[terminated]。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.is_alive（mdp.py:1261）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "alive"
