        },
        {
          "id": "heading_hold",
          "group": "A",
          "label": "保持出生朝向",
          "weight": 1.5,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\exp\\!\\left(-\\Delta\\psi^{2}/\\sigma^{2}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "σ": 0.4,
            "σ²": 0.16
          },
          "desc": "奖励 yaw 角保持在出生朝向附近（走直线）；偏了可以自己转回来拿回分数。",
          "note": "出生 yaw 固定为 0（SPAWN_YAW = (0, 0)），即正对下坡方向，所以这一项就是「沿坡直下」。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.heading_hold_reward（mdp.py:5117）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "heading_hold"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "upright",
          "canonical": "body_upright_gaussian",
          "group": "B",
          "label": "躯干直立（四元数）",
          "weight": 3,
          "direction": "positive",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\exp\\!\\left(-(1-\\cos\\theta)/\\sigma^{2}\\right)",
          "params": {
            "std": 0.2
          },
          "desc": "躯干越接近竖直分越高；相对世界竖直，而不是坡面法向。",
          "note": "与 Rollers / Velocity 的 mjlab upright 不是同一个函数（那个是 exp(−sin²θ/σ²)），所以 canonical 单列为 body_upright_gaussian。本任务删掉了全身 pose，只用这一项和终止条件管平衡，让策略自己找重心。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.body_upright_gaussian（mdp.py:852）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "upright"
          },
          "curve": {
            "x": {
              "tex": "\\theta",
              "range": [
                0,
                1.5708
              ]
            },
            "f": "exp(-(1-cos(x))/(s*s))",
            "params": [
              {
                "id": "s",
                "key": "std",
                "range": [
                  0.05,
                  0.8
                ],
                "log": true
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              "横轴是躯干倾角 θ（rad）。1 − cos θ ≈ θ²/2，所以小角度时等效于 θ 上 σ√2 ≈ 0.28 rad（约 16°）的高斯。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "feet_flat",
          "group": "C",
          "label": "着地刀片放平",
          "weight": -2,
          "direction": "negative",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\sum_{f}\\lVert g^{\\text{site}}_{f,xy}\\rVert^{2}\\cdot\\mathbb{1}\\!\\left[\\text{contact}_f\\right]",
          "desc": "只罚着地刀片的倾斜（sin²θ），让轮子贴地抓牢；腾空的脚可以随意倾斜。",
          "note": "与 Rollers 同一配置（按着地门控）。单脚最大值是 1（docstring 写的约 2.0 不对）。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.feet_flat_penalty（mdp.py:1605）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "feet_flat"
          },
          "curve": {
            "x": {
              "tex": "\\theta_f",
              "range": [
                0,
                1.5708
              ]
            },
            "f": "k*sin(x)^2",
            "held": [
              {
                "id": "k",
                "tex": "k",
                "range": [
                  0,
                  2
                ],
                "value": 1,
                "int": true
              }
            ],
            "notes": [
              "横轴 θ_f 是足端 site 的 z 轴相对竖直的倾角（rad），‖g_xy‖² = sin²θ_f；k 是「着地且倾斜 θ_f」的刀片数（0–2），默认 1。腾空的脚不计入，所以 k 只数着地的脚。单脚最大值 1。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "neck_joint_pos_l2",
          "group": "B",
          "label": "颈头回 HOME",
          "weight": -0.75,
          "direction": "negative",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\lVert q_{\\text{neck}}-q^{\\text{home}}_{\\text{neck}}\\rVert^{2}",
          "desc": "颈、头 4 个关节偏离 HOME 的平方和：让头保持在默认姿态。",
          "note": "比 Rollers 的 −0.5 重：本任务删掉了全身 pose（腿自由找平衡），之前头会乱跑，这一项只约束颈 / 头。函数：mjlab_microduck.tasks.mdp.neck_joint_pos_l2（mdp.py:1697）。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl",
            "path": "src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py",
            "symbol": "neck_joint_pos_l2"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "action_rate_l2",
          "canonical": "action_rate",
          "group": "D",
          "label": "动作变化率",
          "weight": -1,
          "direction": "negative",
          "confidence": "verified",
          "form": "\\lVert a_t-a_{t-1}\\rVert^{2}",
          "desc": "相邻两步动作之差的平方和，压抖动。",
          "note": "唯一从 Rollers 保留下来的奖励项（src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py:127-130）。roller_slope 删除了继承的全部课程（src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microduck_roller_slope_env_cfg.py:219-220），只加了地形课程，所以权重固定 −1.0，没有 Rollers 的 −1.5 / −2.0 阶段。函数：mjlab action_rate_l2。",
          "source": {
            "repo": "mujocolab/mjlab",
